This template is similar to the {{tl|Player}} template, however the race and flag icons are displayed on the right side of the player name. This is useful for
player columns which are aligned to the right.

== Usage ==

Variables and usage like the {{tl|Player}} template.

== Example ==

This code:

 <nowiki>{{player2|NonY|race=|flag=us}}
{{player2|Ret|hs=race|race=|flag=nl}}
{{player2|Ihasnowikipage|hs=race|race=|flag=se}}</nowiki>

Returns this:

:{{player2|NonY|race=|flag=us}}
:{{player2|Ret|hs=race|race=|flag=nl}}
:{{player2|Ihasnowikipage|hs=race|race=|flag=se}}

